1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,230
This is Evidence Review,

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:04,607
an independent concept for Junior's

3
00:00:04,607 --> 00:00:07,119
research workflow. Everything here is

4
00:00:07,119 --> 00:00:09,632
synthetic: a fictional private equity

5
00:00:09,632 --> 00:00:12,280
software deal, with three expert calls.

6
00:00:12,628 --> 00:00:15,219
Before a synthesis goes to a VP or the

7
00:00:15,219 --> 00:00:16,651
investment committee,

8
00:00:16,651 --> 00:00:19,311
each claim is checked against the exact

9
00:00:19,311 --> 00:00:21,424
quotes it cites, with the call,

10
00:00:21,424 --> 00:00:23,402
timestamp, cohort and period.

11
00:00:23,753 --> 00:00:26,088
This claim says renewal prices rose

12
00:00:26,088 --> 00:00:28,890
seven percent. The competitor said twelve,

13
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:30,759
for the same scope and year.

14
00:00:30,759 --> 00:00:32,627
That's a real contradiction.

15
00:00:32,627 --> 00:00:35,029
The customer's twelve percent covers

16
00:00:35,029 --> 00:00:38,031
one firm, so it shows as a cohort difference,

17
00:00:38,031 --> 00:00:39,032
not a conflict.

18
00:00:39,381 --> 00:00:42,017
Click any source, and the transcript

19
00:00:42,017 --> 00:00:43,921
opens right at that quote.

20
00:00:44,271 --> 00:00:45,821
The reviewer decides:

21
00:00:45,821 --> 00:00:47,297
supported, disputed,

22
00:00:47,297 --> 00:00:50,250
or insufficient. A dispute needs a note.

23
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:53,273
This claim stretches mid-market retention

24
00:00:53,273 --> 00:00:55,685
to every segment. I narrow the scope.

25
00:00:55,685 --> 00:00:57,119
The edit is versioned,

26
00:00:57,119 --> 00:00:59,075
and the old review is cleared.

27
00:00:59,534 --> 00:01:01,763
The handoff gate stays blocked while

28
00:01:01,763 --> 00:01:03,311
any claim lacks a source,

29
00:01:03,311 --> 00:01:04,735
or a required decision.

30
00:01:05,084 --> 00:01:06,788
Once the rest are resolved,

31
00:01:06,788 --> 00:01:09,059
the brief can be approved as handoff

32
00:01:09,059 --> 00:01:09,438
ready.

33
00:01:09,787 --> 00:01:12,733
Remove one source, and approval is voided

34
00:01:12,733 --> 00:01:14,171
at once. Restore it,

35
00:01:14,171 --> 00:01:16,614
and it still needs a fresh review.

36
00:01:16,963 --> 00:01:19,339
Open gaps become a follow-up guide,

37
00:01:19,339 --> 00:01:21,783
built from fixed, neutral templates.

38
00:01:21,783 --> 00:01:23,616
Every question is editable,

39
00:01:23,616 --> 00:01:25,856
and leading wording gets flagged.

40
00:01:26,206 --> 00:01:28,314
The export carries source links,

41
00:01:28,314 --> 00:01:30,027
gaps and synthetic labels.

42
00:01:30,027 --> 00:01:31,872
Selected names are redacted,

43
00:01:31,872 --> 00:01:34,178
but a person must read the preview,

44
00:01:34,178 --> 00:01:36,945
and accept that this is not anonymisation.

45
00:01:37,295 --> 00:01:39,466
Metrics show their numerators,

46
00:01:39,466 --> 00:01:41,276
denominators and windows.

47
00:01:41,276 --> 00:01:42,941
No adoption is claimed.

48
00:01:42,941 --> 00:01:45,764
The next step is testing this with real

49
00:01:45,764 --> 00:01:46,560
deal teams.
